  "description": "**Original Webtoon :**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list.nhn?titleId=765470&weekday=sat), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=5951433)\n\nKumuchi, the head of the Great Library of the Temple of the Gods, brings home a child named Yuli from a slave market. Instead of working for the temple, Yuli is assigned a mission: to accompany the temple to a neighboring country to find and bring back the successor to the temple's leader, the \"Sky Master.\" Kumuchi and Yuli leave the Temple of the Gods and embark on a long journey east. Along the way, they meet many different people and travel through many countries. Finally, they encounter the \"Little Sky Master\" they have been searching for",
